iterations.reply:
I left out `aap:caps/http-client` and the enrichment call. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/kb-read@0.1.0`, and the previous build was rejected for importing anything else. Also, the enrichment call sent every customer question to an external host while its result was discarded, so the output gave no sign that the data had left. If the graph's grant changes, the graph definition needs to be updated and reviewed first, and then the node can be rebuilt against it.

